HARP: Healthcare Agent Registration and Connection Profile

Author and architect
  Ric S Kolluri, Founder and CIO, Neomics

HARP was designed, authored, and architected by Ric S Kolluri. Neomics is the
originating organization and the reference implementer. The standard is released
under the MIT License (see LICENSE) and is governed by an open RFC process with a
committed path to a neutral standards body (see GOVERNANCE.md).
